.TH FSTATFS 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
fstatfs \- reads filesystem statistics for an open descriptor into the linux x86-64 kernel statfs layout
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/vfs.h>
.B int fstatfs(int descriptor, struct statfs* buffer);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads filesystem statistics for an open descriptor into the Linux x86-64 kernel statfs layout.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result on success, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fstatfs (2)
